1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:15,720
Brian and I were separated. We still had things to work out. The kids had questions for him. Now they can't ask. I want you to understand that.

2
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:37,620
On each count, thirty years, to run concurrently. The total prison term is thirty years. Your remaining rights are set out in the judgment.

3
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:48,800
Could you sit with my mom till her ride gets here?

4
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:53,880
Of course. I'll find her before I go.

5
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:10,480
The settlement covered winter. This approval is for the next course, under the policy. Different bills. I checked.

6
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:28,280
Tuesday, ten o'clock. Same room. Bring the medication list again.

7
00:01:28,930 --> 00:01:32,840
Tuesday. I need to switch my shift.

8
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:42,660
Do you need a minute?

9
00:01:43,310 --> 00:01:47,740
No. Keep the appointment. I'll work it out.

10
00:01:48,390 --> 00:01:51,250
Can I bring my whale?

11
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:53,180
Please do.

12
00:01:56,800 --> 00:02:04,900
For the course after that, you'll need to apply again. I'll send the checklist early.

13
00:02:05,550 --> 00:02:07,360
But not today?

14
00:02:08,010 --> 00:02:09,290
Not today.

15
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,610
Did you sign?

16
00:02:18,260 --> 00:02:30,030
Yes. I've accepted the findings. I'm out of a job, and I owe a fine. I reported it, but I kept signing.

17
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:33,540
How did the interview go?

18
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:38,660
They asked why I left.

19
00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:42,170
What did you tell them?

20
00:02:42,820 --> 00:02:49,870
That there's a finding against me. I sent the link. They haven't called.

21
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:57,660
Still on the front page?

22
00:02:58,310 --> 00:03:06,410
No. The regulator ordered those files reviewed again. I'm checking who's actually had a call.

23
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:21,280
The sentencing closes the final major chapter in the case.

24
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:24,790
Mom. I changed the wings.

25
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:29,870
Show me. Why are they so big now?

26
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:46,330
The little ones couldn't lift him. He kept landing in the soup.

27
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:49,840
Not there. That's the soup.

28
00:03:50,490 --> 00:03:53,870
Right. Where can I put this?

29
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:57,900
Here. You can do the bubbles.

30
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:19,820
Mara, I don't know how things are at home. I hope Ellie is still getting treatment. You don't have to send me any news.

31
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:32,330
You don't have to write back. I won't speak for you. Luigi.
